---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../../components/SectionHeading.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  eyebrow="Legal Standards"
  description="Terms governing the use of The Blooming Ones Initiative digital properties and donor platforms."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Terms of Service' }]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-on-surface leading-relaxed
      [&>p]:text-body-md [&>p]:text-on-surface-variant [&>p]:mb-6 [&>p]:leading-relaxed
      [&>h2]:font-headline-md [&>h2]:text-primary [&>h2]:mt-10 [&>h2]:mb-4
      [&>h3]:font-title-lg [&>h3]:text-primary [&>h3]:mt-6 [&>h3]:mb-3
      [&>ul]:list-disc [&>ul]:pl-6 [&>ul]:mb-6 [&>ul]:space-y-2 [&>ul>li]:text-on-surface-variant
    ">
      <p class="text-xs text-outline mb-6">Last updated: January 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using the website and online services of The Blooming Ones Initiative, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use this platform.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Nature of Organization</h2>
      <p>
        The Blooming Ones Initiative (formerly operating as The Testybam Initiative) is a registered nonprofit organization operating across Nigeria dedicated to girl-child empowerment, menstrual dignity, education retention, and community care.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Donations & Financial Stewardship</h2>
      <p>
        All financial contributions made through our platforms are voluntary donations dedicated to our charitable programs. In accordance with nonprofit standard operating procedures, donations are non-refundable once disbursed to field supply procurement, unless an erroneous processing duplicate can be verified within 7 business days.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Intellectual Property & Ethical Content</h2>
      <p>
        All photographs, narrative chronicles, logos, and educational materials published on this website are the proprietary property of The Blooming Ones Initiative or used under licensed agreement. Unauthorized reproduction, modification, or commercial re-use of photographs featuring our child beneficiaries is strictly prohibited and subject to legal prosecution.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
